flowchart TB
  H5[客户订货 H5]
  ADMIN[管理后台]
  SCREEN[排行 / 战报 / 抽奖大屏]
  LB[托管 LB / WAF / CDN]
  API[Spring Boot API 运行角色]
  WORKER[Spring Boot Background Worker]
  MIGRATE[独立 Migration Job / Flyway]
  MYSQL[(MySQL 业务主数据)]
  REDIS[(Redis 缓存 / 限流 / 锁；非事实来源)]
  OBJECT[(MinIO / S3 对象存储)]

  H5 -->|REST| LB
  ADMIN -->|REST| LB
  SCREEN -->|REST + SSE| LB
  LB --> API
  API --> MYSQL
  API --> REDIS
  API --> OBJECT
  WORKER --> MYSQL
  WORKER --> REDIS
  WORKER --> OBJECT
  MIGRATE -. 发布步骤 .-> MYSQL

  subgraph BackendModules[后端领域模块]
    ACT[活动]
    CAT[商品与导入]
    CUS[客户与验证]
    ORD[订单与版本]
    DASH[看板统计]
    LOT[抽奖]
    AUTH[管理员与审计]
  end

  API --- BackendModules
  WORKER --- BackendModules
